Subject: [PATCH] fix(editor): a far scroll jump lands where sent in every pane
 (#1240)

WebKitGTK moves the scroll position while CodeMirror swaps a fully
off-screen viewport; a scroll that shows none of the rendered lines
becomes a CodeMirror scroll request with an exact scrollTop.
Minimap compositing layer measured, no gain, not kept (#1241).
